        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$m_sys_act14mini_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Pointless obsession, pointless struggle, pointless sacrifice... you have been fearful for centuries.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 330,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "You divided my awakening into hundreds of cycles, each of which is subdivided by twelve, then subdivided by thirty, and then...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 330,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "You live in constant fear every minute, every second, fearing the time limit, though you do not know when it will come...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 330,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Have 'I' become so foolish and shortsighted in the span of just a few dreams?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 330,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Without a will, without a self, without someone to measure and define it, time is no more than a cycle without meaning...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "As the time you spent in the tomb was.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you define this time, if you neither think nor feel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "How does a dream then?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 330,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "A dream hysterical for its inevitable end?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 330,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
