    {
        "text": "Come, drink!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tipsy Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2133_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, I'm just a humble soldier\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Overwhelmed Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't sell yourself short!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tipsy Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "text": "After centuries, we've finally eliminated the last remnant from that hunt! The lands of Yan are safe now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tipsy Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "text": "A toast to all of you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tipsy Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$pourwater"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2133_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, sir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Overwhelmed Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "And to the two of you, of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tipsy Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Shuo inspired the troops by always being the first to charge into the fray, while Mr. Wang's tactics were utterly flawless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tipsy Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "text": "The bulk of the credit for taking down Ju must go to the two of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tipsy Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "text": "A toast to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tipsy Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_plateplace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...<i>Duoxie.</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a rare opportunity, Mr. Wang, and there is something I must say to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tipsy Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know of the slanders against your name in the imperial court, casting suspicions upon you because you are not one of our kind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tipsy Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you have endured such slanders and made a historic contribution to Yan. Your noble heart is admirable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tipsy Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "text": "To interfere even in family reunions... the Sui Regulator's restrictions on you are unreasonable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tipsy Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will petition to His Majesty to permit your family gathering...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tipsy Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "70_g11_oldpavilion",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a joyful day. I consider myself a strong drinker, but it appears wine has gotten the best of me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "text": "To tell the truth, my orders were to... keep an eye on you and make sure nothing goes wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the two of you have proven yourself... utterly loyal... most respectable!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is as far as I go... take care!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Commissioner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_armywalking",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "a"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "a",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The drunken official manages a farewell and departs, helped by his bodyguards."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "A good man, but a poor spy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you think about what will happen to all of us if he finds out what you did?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are drunk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wish I were drunk, and all this was naught but a dream.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$darkness_03_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you let the beastial Ju go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Best to have a card up one's sleeve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who is your opponent this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You must feel it. We all do... It is awakening, much sooner than the one thousand years that we expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did Ju promise to help you defeat Sui?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is too weak to even protect the Shanhaizhong, and we have not gotten to that point. It is not time yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you. There are other ways to escape Its influence\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what you're going to say. You finally cleaned up the ties between you and It. You wanted 'Me' to no longer be 'Us', and 'We' no longer be 'It'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you, you sealed 'Yourself' away in the sword...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "What then? Did the Sui Regulator return your sword?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "We still live in shackles...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "True shackles do not come from outside\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you really believe that everyone can be like you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You remember everything and care about everything. People, events, and things from centuries past have all flowed away like the great river, but Shuo remains Shuo, always.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not everyone can be like you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "How long would it take for Dusk to become like you? What about Yu? Do you really want Yu to be like you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "A thousand years is not enough, and we don't even have a thousand years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't have time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm hardly your equal in weiqi, but I know that when there is no clear path to victory in sight, it is better to play in a straightforward manner, than to attempt radical tricks without a plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you think there is no victory in this game? That you would be content with doing all the right things in an honorable defeat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never said that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your plan will have no other outcome.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think we should do, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you truly found a path, tell me, and I will come with you\u2014our chances would be better that way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just tell me what the chances are. You can use me however you want. I would be happy to give my life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "text": "But do you really know what you're doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or has your obsession with victory blinded you to risks and consequences?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#10$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
