    },
    {
        "text": "Did you consider it?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "The proxy slams his palm on the stone table\u2014or so he intended to."
    },
    {
        "text": "But he has yet to adapt to his mortal vessel, and he misjudged both the strength and position."
    },
    {
        "text": "A deep crack appears on the weiqi board that Wang always carries with him."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "70_i02_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.25
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wang, I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Impressive, brother. This human body you created for yourself can still split boulders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen to me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "None of us could reach your heights, brother. You need not trouble yourself with our fates.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
