    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$m_sys_act23side_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Had a fight with our eldest brother? Such is written all over your face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I get drunk by the roadside for a couple of hours, and the two of you are already making trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#10$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you have anything to say to him, you can say it to him directly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come now, there is no need for that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what you were fighting over. Sui.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#10$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is not the first time you have fought over this. Can you not accept your differences?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a matter of life and death. It's not something that can be glossed over so easily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you keep fighting, even when the end comes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Run not from the words that need to be said. The longer you delay this, the greater the problem grows.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_footstep_stonestep",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wang... now, now, come back\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_footstep_stonestep",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Weiqi failure! Can you not act your age? Playing the brat in front of your younger sister?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2",
        "focus": "l",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "70_g11_oldpavilion",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ling leads the way while Wang slowly follows behind."
    },
    {
        "text": "They see the eldest proxy still sitting by the pavilion."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#8$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Dage.</i> Our biggest brother.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Little Ling...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have told you, calling me 'Little Ling' makes me feel like a child.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry. Old habits die hard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So it would seem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, smashing things in your rage? Are you the child here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll fetch some good wood and make a new one for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or would you prefer to keep this one? I can ask Nian or Yi to fix it, when they're here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... I recall the days when I had freshly awoken, watching you two fight amongst yourselves, time after time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember the Candleholder asking me anxiously...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'How bad will it get when all your younger siblings are born? Please, give me an estimation so that I can report to the court and get a disaster response plan set up!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#10$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "An idea, <i>Dage:</i> Let me speak to Wang, alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will serve as your messenger this time, in order that you need not break anything else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Very well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, about the weiqi board...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just leave it, brother. I'll repair it myself. No need to trouble yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are still angry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You only address him as 'brother' when you are angry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What were you arguing about? Tell me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is just as I thought.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "His way is the proper way, but it is slow. If It were to suddenly awaken one day, it would all be too late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for you... *sigh*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want to argue with him, should you not at least come up with a plan of your own?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "text": "He gave up his sword to prove our innocence, the sword that means so very much to him. Do you feel no gratitude?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you perhaps... seriously furious that he smashed your board?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just frustrated by his lack of urgency.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We all seek a way. Dusk has even fewer ideas. Does she anger you too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Its awakening is accelerating. We are all anxious, and it is understandable that we might provoke the occasional quarrel with inadvertent words.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it will take centuries for It to awaken. Maintaining a cordial relationship with Yan is the more pressing matter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or are you saying that I, too, lack urgency?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... that's not what I mean.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "You said we're all looking for a way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are <i>you</i> looking for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your ears have merit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It and I, we are all nothing but a dream.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_2023_ling_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is just the seed of an idea, and I know not how far I can go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I hope to leave behind a dream.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "text": "A dream that It cannot disturb, even if It has fully awakened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ling"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
